{"unit_id":"yybukn__dsh-table-attach#card-zh","repo":"yybukn/dsh-table-attach","commit":"02246642068df431282cb5fc8c09d39985706983","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-table-attach 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的文件附件插件，可在会话输入框粘贴或拖放非图片文件。浏览器端拦截文件事件，将文件内容编码后交给主机端服务，保存到当前会话工作区的 attachments 目录，并把工作区相对路径作为 @引用插入输入框。它支持表格、文档和压缩包等非图片文件，保留图片及普通文本的原有输入流程，也提供上传提示、错误提示和中英文界面文案。适合需要让 DSH 会话读取本地表格或文档的网页用户；使用时需先打开一个具有工作区的会话，不需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:423-499","lib/index.js:126-159"]}
{"unit_id":"yybukn__dsh-table-attach#card-en","repo":"yybukn/dsh-table-attach","commit":"02246642068df431282cb5fc8c09d39985706983","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-table-attach adds non-image files to the DSH web composer by paste or drag-and-drop. The host saves files under the current session workspace and inserts an @reference. Images and ordinary text keep their existing paths. A session workspace is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:423-499","lib/index.js:126-159"]}
