{"unit_id":"yybukn__dsh-table-attach#feature-paste","repo":"yybukn/dsh-table-attach","commit":"02246642068df431282cb5fc8c09d39985706983","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-table-attach 的文件粘贴功能：在网页输入框粘贴非图片文件时，拦截文件并上传到当前会话工作区，随后在光标处插入 @路径；普通文本和图片继续由原输入流程处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:471-499"]}
{"unit_id":"yybukn__dsh-table-attach#feature-drop","repo":"yybukn/dsh-table-attach","commit":"02246642068df431282cb5fc8c09d39985706983","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-table-attach 的拖放附件功能：将非图片文件拖入网页时显示提示层，松开后逐个保存文件，并把工作区引用插入输入框；图片拖放交给内置处理流程。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:501-600"]}
{"unit_id":"yybukn__dsh-table-attach#feature-save","repo":"yybukn/dsh-table-attach","commit":"02246642068df431282cb5fc8c09d39985706983","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-table-attach 的工作区保存功能：主机服务接收文件名和 Base64 内容，验证会话工作区路径并写入 attachments 目录；同名文件会追加数字后缀，返回相对路径供输入框引用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:126-159"]}
{"unit_id":"yybukn__dsh-table-attach#feature-insert","repo":"yybukn/dsh-table-attach","commit":"02246642068df431282cb5fc8c09d39985706983","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-table-attach 的引用插入功能：上传成功后将工作区相对路径转换成 @引用，在 Lexical 编辑器或 textarea 的当前光标位置插入，路径有空格时使用引号形式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:265-307"]}
{"unit_id":"yybukn__dsh-table-attach#caveat-workspace","repo":"yybukn/dsh-table-attach","commit":"02246642068df431282cb5fc8c09d39985706983","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-table-attach 使用前须知：附件会写入当前会话工作区的 attachments 子目录，且必须先有可用会话工作区；网页客户端会将文件内容交给主机服务完成保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:403-420","lib/index.js:126-159"]}
